    "text": "Men \u00fea leofestan, utan ge\u00feencan georne and on ure ge\u00feance \u00fe\u00e6t f\u00e6ste healdan, hu sanctus iacobus\nAc he w\u00e6s slaw and sw\u00e6rmod to godan \u00feingan and him w\u00e6s la\u00f0 \u00feearfendum mannum aht to syllanne,\nAc se h\u00e6lend hine \u00feara leana eft gemyngade, \u00fea he cw\u00e6\u00f0 Ne gemundust \u00feu na salomones cwyde \u00fee he\nSe cleopa\u00f0 to me and ic hine symle gehyre and mine miltse ofer \u00feone sende.\nEfne hit bi\u00f0 gelic \u00fee man mid w\u00e6tere \u00feone weallendan lig ofgeote \u00fe\u00e6t he lenge ne mot rixian.\nSwa \u00feonne man mid \u00e6lmessan ealle alyse\u00f0 his gyltas and his synna geh\u00e6le\u00f0, \u00feonne noldest \u00feu welega\nHwi noldest \u00feu ge\u00fe\u00e6ncan hwa hit \u00fee sealde \u00feonne he clypode earmre stemne?\n\u00deu wi\u00f0soce \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu hine ne gehyrdest, ac is geomerunge gehyrde and geseah hw\u00e6t \u00feu him dydest.\nMine \u00feearfan \u00fee mildheortnesse b\u00e6dan, and \u00feu hi forhogodest and geunrotsodest and \u00feinne andwlite\nSe \u00fee his andwlitan fram \u00feam \u00feearfan aw\u00e6nde\u00f0 \u00feonne he hludast clypa\u00f0, god hine gehyre\u00f0 \u00feonne se\nFor hwi forseage \u00feu me nu her of \u00fe\u00e6re gife \u00fee ic \u00fee geaf?\nIc \u00fee nu afyrre fram mine sel\u00e6ne \u00fee ic \u00fee forgeaf, \u00feonne bist \u00feu w\u00e6dla on woruldlife.\nForhwon noldest \u00feu ge\u00fe\u00e6ncan \u00fe\u00e6t ic wille forgyldan \u00e6ghwylce ane gode d\u00e6de \u00fee man for minum\nIc hit him forgilde, swa hit is on minum godspelle gecweden.\nSwa lange and swa oft swa gedo\u00f0 \u00e6nigum minum \u00feam l\u00e6stan \u00feearfiendan ge hit symle me sylla\u00f0 and\nGehyrest \u00feu man towhon eart \u00feu me swa uncu\u00f0ful minra godra gifena, hw\u00e6t ic \u00fee gesceop and \u00fee\nMin is eal \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu hafast and \u00fein nis nanwiht.\nIc hit eal afyrre fram \u00fee and \u00feu leofa